--- !u!114 &410594956
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 410594952}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d9366127076758c4d9758f83d75a66b2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _textContent:
  - _loc: 0
    _content: "<b>Une nouvelle \xE9toile montante de la t\xE9l\xE9vision</b>\n\nLe
      journaliste Carl Morel remporte un nouveau prix de journalisme gr\xE2ce \xE0
      son dernier reportage sur la Mafia am\xE9ricaine. Ce jeune auteur brille sur
      la sc\xE8ne t\xE9l\xE9vis\xE9e depuis maintenant quelque temps, et ne semble
      pas vouloir arr\xEAter son assencion. Le monde du journalisme accueille une
      nouvelle g\xE9n\xE9ration qui semble savoir quelle direction prendre.\nBonne
      chance \xE0 Mr.Morel, et qu\u2019il continue \xE0 faire briller le journalisme
      moderne."
  - _loc: 1
    _content: '<b>A Rising Star of Television</b>


      Journalist Carl Morel has
      won another journalism award for his latest report on the American Mafia. This
      young writer has been shining on the television scene for some time now and
      shows no signs of slowing down his ascent. The world of journalism is welcoming
      a new generation that seems to know exactly which direction to take.

      Good
      luck to Mr. Morel, and may he continue to make modern journalism shine.'
  _textOverride: {fileID: 0}
